silm:instances_papers_09_minimal_category_theory_chapters_01_objects_and_arrows_sections_03_hom_sets_and_disjointness_yoneda_hom_leg_2_aboutness_leg silm:hasExample "In 'S03HomSetsAndDisjointnessYonedaHomLeg2', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, the VetRecord77 -> Mittens aboutness leg; an information arrow, not an isomorphism" .
